  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Saf-C 5000 DISPLAY FIREWORKS\n\nRevision Note:\n\nDocument #6055, eff 7-1-95, readopted with amendments and renumbered Parts Saf-C 1640 through Saf-C 1665 as Chapter Saf-C 5000. The prior filings for former Saf-C 1640 through Saf-C 1665 include the following documents:\n\n#4584, eff 3-3-89\n\n#5429, eff 6-25-92\n\n#5996, INTERIM, eff 3-3-95, EXPIRES, 7-1-95\n\n#6054, eff 7-1-95",
